{
    "title": "PNK - Chat now",
    "description": "Welcome to PNK, where meeting new people of your age has never been that easy. PNK is a safe space for everyone to have fun. \r\nPNK is a place where you can make new friends, even from all over the world.\r\n\r\nSwipe and Chat now with Real People!\r\n\r\nTOP 5 THINGS TO KNOW ABOUT PNK\r\n1). SWIPE TO CONNECT: Swipe through the app to find people who are online when you are.\r\n\r\n2). CHAT IN REAL TIME: One of the most exciting things about PNK is that you can instantly chat with people worldwide.\r\n\r\n3). CHAT WITH YOUR CREW: Engage in conversations with peers your own age, ensuring a safer and more relatable experience.\r\n\r\n4). SAFETY FIRST: We take your safety very seriously. That\u2019s why we have an age gate, plus additional safety features for any users.\r\n\r\nYour personal data is securely stored on PNK - be sure to read our privacy policy and terms and conditions:\r\nhttps://www.pnk.app/en/privacy\r\nhttps://www.pnk.app/en/terms\r\n\r\nRemember, PNK is all about good vibes! But if you're posting anything inappropriate, we'll have to say bye-bye. So, dive into PNK today and start making those connections!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to PNK, where meeting new people of your age has never been that easy. PNK is a safe space for everyone to have fun. <br>PNK is a place where you can make new friends, even from all over the world.<br><br>Swipe and Chat now with Real People!<br><br>TOP 5 THINGS TO KNOW ABOUT PNK<br>1). SWIPE TO CONNECT: Swipe through the app to find people who are online when you are.<br><br>2). CHAT IN REAL TIME: One of the most exciting things about PNK is that you can instantly chat with people worldwide.<br><br>3). CHAT WITH YOUR CREW: Engage in conversations with peers your own age, ensuring a safer and more relatable experience.<br><br>4). SAFETY FIRST: We take your safety very seriously. That\u2019s why we have an age gate, plus additional safety features for any users.<br><br>Your personal data is securely stored on PNK - be sure to read our privacy policy and terms and conditions:<br>https://www.pnk.app/en/privacy<br>https://www.pnk.app/en/terms<br><br>Remember, PNK is all about good vibes! But if you&#39;re posting anything inappropriate, we&#39;ll have to say bye-bye. So, dive into PNK today and start making those connections!",
